  "description": "Twenty-five Hongmarye, she spent her life pretending to die while looking at the sunset painting she had drawn. \n\n'Wheat and Barley Grow’, a game that came like ‘fate’ The game that came as such a shock that it felt like my nose was broken? \n\nThe smell of dirt covers Mare’s life.\" I don't think I hate it.\" \n\n(Source: Comico, translated)",
